  "releaseNotes": "CloudYxt .Net Core针对OpenTelemetry常规操作库。\n\n\t\t\t2.0.0\n\t\t\t升级依赖.net10.0\n\n\t\t\t1.1.2\n\t\t\t修正logs的service_name会出现unknown_service的问题，注意：务必先进行logging.AddOpenTelemetryLoggingExtensions日志注册，再添加服务builder.Services.AddOpenTelemetryExtensions\n\n\t\t\t1.1.0\n\t\t\t增加NetworkHelper.GetLocalIPv4()和NetworkHelper.GetLocalIPv4All()方法\n\n\t\t\t1.0.0\n\t\t\t实现OpenTelemetry的配置简化",
